window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><em>She’s blonde, blue eyed and has got curves for days.</em><br><br><em>A California dream us southern boys never get the chance to touch.</em><br><br><em>She’s all I could ever need, want, desire,</em><br><br><em>&amp; I’ll change my whole world just to keep her in it.</em><br><br><em>But when her lips meet mine, and our craving for each other pushes us further than we ever expected, will she choose us?</em><br><br><em>Or could sacrificing everything for her prove to be the biggest mistake I’ve ever made?</em><br><br><em>Faced with our end before we ever really give us a chance, there is one thing I know for certain.</em> <br><br><em>I’ll never regret it.</em><br><br><em>Her. Me.</em><br><br><em>The feeling of us.</em><br><br><em>Even long after my fantasy fades.</em></p>"; 
